  "body": "MOVE TO A SAFE AND SECURE COMMUNITY THAT FITS YOUR LIFE, NO MATTER WHAT THAT LOOKS LIKE.\r\n\r\nA home that doesn't compromise on comfort, supports your independence, and means you'll never have to walk up stairs again thanks to your own private lift providing effortless access across every level.\r\n\r\nSet in a stunning Eastern Bays location where safety and security are top of mind, this is low maintenance luxury with no detail overlooked, all just minutes from some of Auckland's best beachside cafes and bars.\r\n\r\nIt's lifestyle living at its best with outstanding finishing and value in every detail, combined with a beautifully landscaped outdoor area perfect for entertaining family and friends or simply sitting back in the sun with your favourite book.\r\n\r\n6D Jane Gifford is now SOLD and settled. \r\n\r\nYour new home has...\r\n\r\n* A private lift for internal access between levels\r\n* Master Suite with walk in wardrobe and ensuite \r\n* Ducted central heating and cooling throughout\r\n* Tiled internal access garage with laundry and built in storage\r\n* Full kitchen with pull out pantry and Bosch appliances....plentiful storage\r\n* Underfloor heating in bathrooms for everyday comfort\r\n* Security alarm and door camera system for peace of mind\r\n* Smart storage systems throughout.\r\n* 10 year Master Build warranty and a 1 year maintenance warranty\r\n* CCC and titles have been issued\r\n\r\nSo come and enjoy the perfect balance of comfort, convenience and lifestyle combined with the safety and security only a home of this quality,value and location can guarantee. The marina, ferry terminal, coastal walkways and stunning local cafes are all literally minutes away. This is your chance to be part of a special community.\r\n\r\nYou'll need to be quick to secure your new future.\r\n\r\nCall Renee or Simon today! These homes are truly something special.",
